      "source": "Mustache TemplateLoader implementation that uses a prefix, suffix and the Spring\nResource abstraction to load a template from a file, classpath, URL etc. A\n<code>Mustache.TemplateLoader</code> is needed in the <code>Mustache.Compiler</code> when you want to render\npartials (i.e. tiles-like features).",
      "translation": "使用前缀、后缀以及 Spring Resource 抽象来从文件、类路径、URL 等加载模板的 Mustache TemplateLoader 实现。当您需要渲染部分（即类似磁贴的功能）时，<code>Mustache.Compiler</code> 需要 <code>Mustache.TemplateLoader</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
